  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/md78MGbEfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-plural\"></a></p>\n<h1>Create：钱币系统</h1>\n<p>《钱币系统》是一款全新的货币模组，提供简单易用的基础商店系统，同时也为你的“红石资本主义”梦想留出了充分的发挥空间。</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/vendor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/creative_vendor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<h3>交易商</h3>\n<p>快速买卖物品，专为紧凑的玩家经营商店设计。</p>\n<p>创造模式版本允许服务器管理员设置无限补货的商店。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/bank_terminal.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<h3>银行终端</h3>\n<p>访问你的虚拟银行账户，进行金币的存取操作。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/andesite_depositor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/brass_depositor.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<h3>存款器</h3>\n<p>设定价格后，当玩家通过背包持有金币或使用卡片存入资金时，存款器将发出持续1个红石刻的信号脉冲。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>钱币</h3>\n<p>本模组的核心经济支柱，提供6种不同面值的钱币供你选择。</p>\n<table style=\"width:70.5514%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">刺钉</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">斜面</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">链轮</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">齿轮</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.7235%\">王冠</th>\n<th style=\"width:16.3823%\">太阳</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">1 刺钉</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">8 刺钉</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">16 刺钉</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">64 刺钉</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%;text-align:center\">8 齿轮</td>\n<td style=\"width:16.3823%;text-align:center\">64 齿轮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/spur.png\" alt=\"刺钉\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/bevel.png\" alt=\"斜面\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/sprocket.png\" alt=\"链轮\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/cog.png\" alt=\"齿轮\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.7235%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/crown.png\" alt=\"王冠\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n<td style=\"width:16.3823%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/sun.png\" alt=\"太阳\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/red_card.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/red_id_card.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<h3>银行卡与身份卡</h3>\n<p>将银行卡放入存款器或交易商中，即可使资金直接存入关联账户。此外，在交易商或存款器上使用银行卡，会从你的账户中提取资金，而非从背包中扣除金币。</p>\n<p>身份卡用于授权其他玩家访问《钱币系统》受保护的方块（交易商、存款器和烈焰银行家），方便你轻松为商业伙伴开放权限。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Layers-of-Railways/ImageDump/main/numismatics/blaze_banker.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<h3>烈焰银行家</h3>\n<p>一个银行账户无法满足你的 <del>逃税</del> 商业需求？再开设一个，并使用身份卡允许你的商业伙伴提取资金。</p>",
